{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27634","headline":"少年乐 · 张祜","name":"少年乐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"二十便封侯，名居第一流。\n绿鬟深小院，清管下高楼。\n醉把金船掷，闲敲玉镫游。\n带盘红鼹鼠，袍砑紫犀牛。\n锦袋归调箭，罗鞋起拨球。\n眼前长贵盛，那信世间愁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27634.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27634","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}